<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18825" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχῠρον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], τό,</span> mostly in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχυρα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chaff, bran, husks</i> left
			after threshing or grinding, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				161
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				226.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				18.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς ἀ. κυλινδομένην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
					47
				</span></i>
			: sg., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>, etc.: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνος εἰς
			ἄχυρα</span> 'pig in clover', of unexpected good fortune, <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				188
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				76
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχυρα τῶν
			ἀστῶν,</span> of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτοικοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				508
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχυρα ἀπὸ τοῦ τοίχου
			ἀποσπᾶν,</span> of dying persons, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in pl.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. χρυσοχοϊκά</span>
			<i>slag</i> from gold-smelting, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
